:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bestreviews.com</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#0e101a;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> and “Best Seller” on </span><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/iHealth-COVID-19-Authorized-Non-invasive-Discomfort/dp/B09KZ6TBNY/ref=lp_23480822011_1_1\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Amazon</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#0e101a;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">. The iHealth test was made to detect whether or not an individual has the COVID-19 in 15 minutes and has the best performance between positive and negative tests, according to </span><a href=\"https://www.medrxiv.org/content/10.1101/2022.02.17.22271142v1\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">medRxiv</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#0e101a;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-c050386f-7fff-8e7f-b3c3-022191efbfd9\"><br></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><a href=\"https://ihealthlabs.com/products/ihealth-track-connected-blood-pressure-monitor\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">iHealth Track Connected Blood Pressure Monitor</span></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#0e101a;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Blood pressure is a significant health indicator that may help you evaluate your risk of developing several health problems. Our</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><a href=\"https://ihealthlabs.com/products/ihealth-track-connected-blood-pressure-monitor\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">iHealth Track Connected Blood Pressure Monitor</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#0e101a;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> was ranked “Best Blood Pressure Monitors of 2022” by </span><a href=\"https://www.forbes.com/health/healthy-aging/best-blood-pressure-monitors/\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Forbes Health</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#0e101a;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">. With the press of one button, you can view your results directly on display without connecting to a smartphone. Its color-coded backlit design facilitates visual interpretation of your blood pressure levels. You may also share your results with your doctor by exporting data to Excel, PDF, or CSV files.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><b style=\"font-weight:normal;\"><br></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><a href=\"https://ihealthlabs.com/products/ihealth-nexus-wireless-body-composition-scale\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">iHealth Nexus Wireless Body Composition Scale</span></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(14, 16, 26); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The</span><a href=\"https://ihealthlabs.com/products/ihealth-nexus-wireless-body-composition-scale\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; text-decoration-line: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline;\">iHealth Nexus Wireless Body Composition Scale</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(14, 16, 26); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> is an elegant and reliable wireless body composition weight scale designed to quickly measure, track, and share your fitness data and progress. Four super-sensitive G-shaped sensors are integrated with an advanced BIA (bioelectric impedance analysis) algorithm to ensure accuracy within 0.2 pounds of your weight. It can also store data for up to 8 users and automatically recognizes the person based on their weight while allowing a five-pound weight shift. </span><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-indent: 36pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Feel free to reach out to us if you have any questions or concerns at marketing@ihealthlabs.com. We are looking forward to working with you! </span></p></span></span></div></span></span></span></div>",
